IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-LEDGER-AUDIT.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.

# COBOL Financial Ledger Audit Strategy Example
# Sets evaluation scales and weights for account ledger validations.

SET depth 4;
SET abductive 10;

# Adjust priorities for key bank registers and audit tracks
WEIGHT 50 2;
WEIGHT 51 3;

# Prune inactive or low-priority account processing jobs
PRUNE 12;
EVAL;
